      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA ECLIPSE (2) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 8 lengths at this track in a handy 30.06 beating Claret And Blue. Draws to advantage and likes the trip. Got the money at her only try from this box. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. ZAZU'S JOURNEY (6) is having his first start around this course. Comes here a last start placegetter at Q Lakeside in a Grade 4/5 (25.62). Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from two starts. Well-placed to take this out. TUCKEROO ROAD (5) filled a minor placing last start at Q Lakeside behind Critical Moment (22.06) in a Grade 5. Stalked the pace but found the line strongly. Expected to be in the finish again. BEXLEY (1) is worth consideration.",
